" (path "/a9b30186-7c04-56eb-a4a0-8936bbbeb3f8/6d0b58d6-5a3d-5f49-a77e-f3b81a8a2bdd" (reference "C110") (unit 1)))))(text "ARTIFICIAL ELECTRICAL LOADS ONLY / FIRST MONITORING SLICE" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid f900882d-67a6-5b86-a187-f4a6235fdf78))(text "No current driver, HV router, differential compliance circuit, independent watchdog, MCU or PCB is completed here." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 020714ad-472b-5304-90fe-473dea8b8a13))(text "Q=-10k*22n/40*(V_end-V_start); 600nC=109.091mV nominal. Take BASELINE, CATH, ANODE, NET/TAIL endpoints." (at 20.32 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 104802b7-4ab8-5b9b-8d3d-188c757256f3))(text "Cathodic and anodic charges remain separate. Opposed phases can cancel: final net alone cannot qualify delivery." (at 20.32 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0009c3c3-b3fb-5d88-88b7-fc24e940233e))(text "Actual current-tail/window evidence is required. Command edges, the comparator or an ideal16-bit LSB do not certify precision." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 5af7990e-e945-5157-a60f-98c0fde9ca4d))(text "CLRN = HI_OK AND LO_OK AND EXT_SUP_OK. Any low latches Q off; rising REARM admits only while CLRN is high." (at 20.32 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 2b521b24-9e62-5ddf-895c-0af4f9b25938)))
